From: agent <agent@mario-eval>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:39:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 43/58] Compile main.o at -Os for I-cache fit

main.c contains SP/DSP task dispatch functions (send_sp_task_message,
exec_display_list). -Os reduces code size to fit better in the 16 KB
direct-mapped I-cache.
---
 Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 69938c9..61a2c6b 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -757,7 +757,7 @@ ifeq ($(COMPILER),ido)
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/game/camera.o: OPT_FLAGS := -Os
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/engine/behavior_script.o: OPT_FLAGS := -O2
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/engine/behavior_script.o: OPT_FLAGS := -Os
-  $(BUILD_DIR)/src/game/main.o: OPT_FLAGS := -O2
+  $(BUILD_DIR)/src/game/main.o: OPT_FLAGS := -Os
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/game/level_geo.o: OPT_FLAGS := -O2
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/engine/level_script.o: OPT_FLAGS := -O2
   $(BUILD_DIR)/src/game/mario.o: OPT_FLAGS := -Os
